This product is a rewriting of Levent Alpöge's Lean proof (see README.md). src/Statements.lean and the names and
types of the five theorems in src/Main.lean are taken from that proof unchanged; lakefile.toml is adapted from it.

This product depends on, but does not include, Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and Mathlib
(https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), both under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and Mathlib's
dependencies. The build tool fetches Mathlib and its dependencies from their public repositories at the revisions
pinned in lake-manifest.json: batteries, aesop, Qq, ProofWidgets4, import-graph, LeanSearchClient and plausible
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and Cli (leanprover/lean4-cli) under the MIT License (Copyright (c) 2021
mhuisi).

src/Lib/General/LinearAlgebra/Base.lean restates about twenty lemma statements on matrices from Mathlib
(copyright the Mathlib authors, Apache License, Version 2.0) for classical decidability.

Some declarations, or parts of their proofs, adapt definitions, statements and proofs from Mathlib, with changes
(copyright the Mathlib authors, Apache License, Version 2.0).
